{"title":"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The circumference of the circle with center <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is divided into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> equal arcs, marked the letters <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> as seen below. What is the number of degrees in the sum of the angles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/1/371f42726ae702ba57a0002d787f0e3c62767ec2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(230); defaultpen(linewidth(0.65)); pair O=origin; pair[] circum = new pair[12]; string[] let = {&quot;$A$&quot;,&quot;$B$&quot;,&quot;$C$&quot;,&quot;$D$&quot;,&quot;$E$&quot;,&quot;$F$&quot;,&quot;$G$&quot;,&quot;$H$&quot;,&quot;$I$&quot;,&quot;$J$&quot;,&quot;$K$&quot;,&quot;$L$&quot;}; draw(unitcircle); for(int i=0;i&lt;=11;i=i+1) { circum[i]=dir(120-30*i); dot(circum[i],linewidth(2.5)); label(let[i],circum[i],2*dir(circum[i])); } draw(O--circum[4]--circum[0]--circum[6]--circum[8]--cycle); label(&quot;$x$&quot;,circum[0],2.75*(dir(circum[0]--circum[4])+dir(circum[0]--circum[6]))); label(&quot;$y$&quot;,circum[6],1.75*(dir(circum[6]--circum[0])+dir(circum[6]--circum[8]))); label(&quot;$O$&quot;,O,dir(60)); [/asy]\" width=\"385\" height=\"378\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/7/da726726149be9bc23dbe1393c8eb6127c25e7b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }75\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }80\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }90\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }120\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }150$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"416\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The measure of an inscribed angle is half the measure of its corresponding central angle. Since each unit arc is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/0/e10f7b229549d9afbdef6ae2862bc89bacfe16cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> of the circle's circumference, each unit central angle measures <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/6/a96c5f9f757fd00fbd1b98a8df1c9871924331b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{360}{12}^{\\circ}=30^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"40\" />. From this, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/4/fc4116a455ef319b19c994bf6390d1acdf088d1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle EOG = 60^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"108\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/5/d65d6bf422d39506d0f3e84b3743c8026b5a430f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 30^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" />. Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/0/0d087c66d30ef9baaa6911acd5b81596da9aa098.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AOI = 120^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"111\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/a/54aeaaceee24c7e31f5e098bf6fee050406bf258.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 60^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />. The number of degrees in the sum of both angles is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/0/940247dfa5b5dbf503b469c272620c5eb5ac4fca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30 + 60 = \\boxed{(C)\\ 90}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"153\" height=\"32\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/4/0b4fff5474b5b5ed66f404bb904a64de282be2e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AOE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"18\" /> is isosceles and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/8/fc801a747475db5d1ee2668aa03d60337d0b0f5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AOE = \\frac{4}{12} \\cdot 360^{\\circ} = 120^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"211\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/5/d65d6bf422d39506d0f3e84b3743c8026b5a430f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 30^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/6/87672aa28462de62b476f5ab125b3bb60f68d605.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle GOI$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" /> is isosceles and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/d/fbd9679e08eb16d4ca1174e04a9e70e5370ce189.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle GOI = \\frac{2}{12} \\cdot 360^{\\circ} = 60^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"197\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/a/54aeaaceee24c7e31f5e098bf6fee050406bf258.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 60^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />. The number of degrees in the sum of both angles is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/3/5b3bddd7155e4a77c45459ff5074fd67d6dc95be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30+60 = \\boxed{(C)\\ 90}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"148\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>-edited by Luke\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/3QHH9xV-QDw\">https://youtu.be/3QHH9xV-QDw</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qseG63LK4AU\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qseG63LK4AU</a>\n~David\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/aZhjhb3mMfg\">https://youtu.be/aZhjhb3mMfg</a>\n~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_4\">Video Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/abSgjn4Qs34?t=3242\">https://youtu.be/abSgjn4Qs34?t=3242</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8\" title=\"2014 AMC 8\">2014 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2014\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a 